-- src:11718 | (b) include in the register any documents delivered under section 859A(3) or (5), 859B(3), (4) or (7), or 859C(3).
@ref s 859I(2)(b) include in the register any documents delivered under section 859A(3) or (5), 859B(3), (4) or (7), or 859C(3) (src:11718-11718)
GIVEN `s 859I(1) this section applies` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
