    IF `the charge was registered under section 859A or 859B` AND `the certificate was given under this section`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `the charge was registered under section 859A or 859B`
         THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no certificate has been given under this section
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "In the case of registration under section 859A or 859B"

