§§ `s 859J Company holding property or undertaking as trustee`

-- src:11729 | (1) Where a company is acting as trustee of property or undertaking which is the subject of a charge delivered for registration under this Chapter, the company or any person interested in the charge may deliver to the registrar a statement to that effect.
