        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A statement delivered after the delivery for registration of the charge must include—": the duty is laid on a later statement; the text says nothing of any other statement
        IF item EQUALS `s 859J(2) anything else`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "must include—": the list names two items and is not closed with "only"
