§§ `s 859K Registration of enforcement of security`

-- (1): when subsection (2) applies
-- src:11734 | (1) Subsection (2) applies where a person—
-- src:11735 | (a) obtains an order for the appointment of a receiver or manager of a company's property or undertaking, or
-- src:11736 | (b) appoints such a receiver or manager under powers contained in an instrument.
