`s 859K(1) subsection (2) applies` MEANS
    IF `a person obtains an order for the appointment of a receiver or manager of a company's property or undertaking` OR `a person appoints such a receiver or manager under powers contained in an instrument`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsection (2) applies where a person—"

