-- (1), (8) and (9) read together: whether the person has the duty of subsection (2)
GIVEN `s 859K(1) subsection (2) applies` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 859K(8) this section applies to the receiver or manager` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 859K(9) this section applies to the receiver` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 859K(1), (8) and (9) the person must give notice to the registrar` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (`s 859K(1) subsection (2) applies` EQUALS JUST FALSE) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsection (2) applies where a person—"
        IF (`s 859K(8) this section applies to the receiver or manager` EQUALS JUST FALSE) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section applies only to a receiver or manager appointed—"
        IF (`s 859K(9) this section applies to the receiver` EQUALS JUST FALSE) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section does not apply to a receiver appointed under Chapter 2 of Part 3 of the Insolvency Act 1986"
        IF (`s 859K(1) subsection (2) applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE) AND (`s 859K(8) this section applies to the receiver or manager` EQUALS JUST TRUE) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent)

