-- (2)(b), (3)(b), (4): what the second notice contains. "in the case of a charge created before 6th April 2013" and "on or after" divide the charges.
DECLARE `s 859K(4) item of information` IS ONE OF
    `s 859K(4)(a) the date of the creation of the charge`
    `s 859K(4)(b) a description of the instrument (if any) creating or evidencing the charge`
    `s 859K(4)(c) short particulars of the property or undertaking charged`
    `s 859K(2)(b)(ii) the unique reference code allocated to the charge`
    `s 859K anything else`

-- src:11739 | (b) if the order was obtained, or the appointment made, by virtue of a registered charge held by the person give the registrar a notice containing—
-- src:11740 | (i) in the case of a charge created before 6th April 2013, the information specified in subsection (4);
-- src:11741 | (ii) in the case of a charge created on or after 6th April 2013, the unique reference code allocated to the charge.
@ref s 859K(2)(b) if the order was obtained, or the appointment made, by virtue of a registered charge held by the person give the registrar a notice containing (src:11739-11741)
GIVEN `the order was obtained, or the appointment made, by virtue of a registered charge held by the person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date of creation of the charge` IS A DATE
      item IS A `s 859K(4) item of information`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 859K(2)(b) the notice to the registrar must contain the item` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the order was obtained, or the appointment made, by virtue of a registered charge held by the person`)
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the order was obtained, or the appointment made, by virtue of a registered charge held by the person"
        IF item EQUALS `s 859K anything else` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "give the registrar a notice containing—"
        IF `the date of creation of the charge` LESS THAN Date 6 4 2013 AND item EQUALS `s 859K(2)(b)(ii) the unique reference code allocated to the charge`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in the case of a charge created on or after 6th April 2013, the unique reference code allocated to the charge": this charge was created before 6 April 2013
        IF `the date of creation of the charge` LESS THAN Date 6 4 2013
        THEN JUST TRUE -- the text requires, "in the case of a charge created before 6th April 2013, the information specified in subsection (4)": this charge was created before 6 April 2013: items (a) to (c) of subsection (4)
        IF item EQUALS `s 859K(2)(b)(ii) the unique reference code allocated to the charge` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in the case of a charge created before 6th April 2013, the information specified in subsection (4)": this charge was created on or after 6 April 2013, so the subsection (4) information is not required

