§§ `s 859O Notification of addition to or amendment of charge`

-- src:11800 | (1) This section applies where, after the creation of a charge, the charge is amended by adding or amending a term that—
-- src:11801 | (a) prohibits or restricts the creation of any fixed security or any other charge having priority over, or ranking pari passu with, the charge; or
-- src:11802 | (b) varies, or otherwise regulates the order of, the ranking of the charge in relation to any fixed security or any other charge.
@ref s 859O(1) This section applies where, after the creation of a charge, the charge is amended by adding or amending a term (src:11800-11802)
GIVEN `after the creation of the charge, the charge is amended by adding or amending a term` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the term prohibits or restricts the creation of any fixed security or any other charge having priority over, or ranking pari passu with, the charge` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the term varies, or otherwise regulates the order of, the ranking of the charge in relation to any fixed security or any other charge` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 859O(1) this section applies` MEANS
    IF       `after the creation of the charge, the charge is amended by adding or amending a term`
         AND (    `the term prohibits or restricts the creation of any fixed security or any other charge having priority over, or ranking pari passu with, the charge`
              OR  `the term varies, or otherwise regulates the order of, the ranking of the charge in relation to any fixed security or any other charge`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section applies where, after the creation of a charge, the charge is amended by adding or amending a term that—"

