      `the particulars give the date of creation of the charge` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the particulars give a description of the instrument by which the charge was created or evidenced` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the particulars give short particulars of the property or undertaking charged as set out when the charge was registered` IS A BOOLEAN
