                   AND `the particulars give short particulars of the property or undertaking charged as set out when the charge was registered`)
              OR  (    `the date of creation of the charge` AT LEAST Date 6 4 2013
                   AND ((NOT `a unique reference code has been allocated to the charge`) OR `the particulars give the unique reference code allocated to the charge`)))
